{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type ThreeModifierHotkey = \n  | `Control+Alt+Shift+${Key}`\n  | `Control+Alt+Meta+${Key}`\n  | `Control+Shift+Meta+${Key}`\n  | `Alt+Shift+Meta+${Key}`\n  | `Mod+Alt+Shift+${Key}`;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/hotkey.types.ts#L53","children":[{"type":"text","value":"hotkey.types.ts:53"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Three modifier + key combinations."}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Platform-adaptive "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod"},{"type":"text","value":" combinations:"}]}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod+Alt+Shift"},{"type":"text","value":" is included (safe on all platforms)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod+Control+Shift"},{"type":"text","value":" and "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod+Shift+Meta"},{"type":"text","value":" are excluded because they create duplicate modifiers:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod+Control+Shift"},{"type":"text","value":" duplicates "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Control"},{"type":"text","value":" on Windows/Linux (Mod = Control)"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Mod+Shift+Meta"},{"type":"text","value":" duplicates "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Meta"},{"type":"text","value":" on macOS (Mod = Meta)"}]}]}]}]}]}],"headings":[]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype ThreeModifierHotkey = \n  | `Control+Alt+Shift+${Key}`\n  | `Control+Alt+Meta+${Key}`\n  | `Control+Shift+Meta+${Key}`\n  | `Alt+Shift+Meta+${Key}`\n  | `Mod+Alt+Shift+${Key}`;\n```\n\nDefined in: [hotkey.types.ts:53](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/hotkey.types.ts#L53)\n\nThree modifier + key combinations.\n\n**Platform-adaptive `Mod` combinations:**\n- `Mod+Alt+Shift` is included (safe on all platforms)\n- `Mod+Control+Shift` and `Mod+Shift+Meta` are excluded because they create duplicate modifiers:\n  - `Mod+Control+Shift` duplicates `Control` on Windows/Linux (Mod = Control)\n  - `Mod+Shift+Meta` duplicates `Meta` on macOS (Mod = Meta)\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: ThreeModifierHotkey\ntitle: ThreeModifierHotkey\n---\n\n```ts\ntype ThreeModifierHotkey = \n  | `Control+Alt+Shift+${Key}`\n  | `Control+Alt+Meta+${Key}`\n  | `Control+Shift+Meta+${Key}`\n  | `Alt+Shift+Meta+${Key}`\n  | `Mod+Alt+Shift+${Key}`;\n```\n\nDefined in: [hotkey.types.ts:53](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/hotkey.types.ts#L53)\n\nThree modifier + key combinations.\n\n**Platform-adaptive `Mod` combinations:**\n- `Mod+Alt+Shift` is included (safe on all platforms)\n- `Mod+Control+Shift` and `Mod+Shift+Meta` are excluded because they create duplicate modifiers:\n  - `Mod+Control+Shift` duplicates `Control` on Windows/Linux (Mod = Control)\n  - `Mod+Shift+Meta` duplicates `Meta` on macOS (Mod = Meta)\n"}
